{
  "_comment": [
    "The standard eventd deployment paths. All six values are required:",
    "eventd intentionally has no compiled fallback that could write audit data",
    "somewhere an operator did not choose.",
    "",
    "The package supplies the three empty /var/state directories. peinit",
    "supplies /run/eventd through RuntimeDirectories in eventd-service.reg.",
    "",
    "This seed is inert until an image names eventd-config.reg in its",
    "[registry] autoapply list. Tuning values are omitted because eventd's",
    "compiled defaults are the canonical defaults documented by regman."
  ],
  "keys": [
    { "path": "Machine\\System" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\eventd",
      "values": [
        { "name": "EventStorePath",  "type": "sz", "data": "/var/state/eventd/events/" },
        { "name": "LogStorePath",    "type": "sz", "data": "/var/state/eventd/logs/" },
        { "name": "MetricStorePath", "type": "sz", "data": "/var/state/eventd/metrics/" },
        { "name": "QuerySocketPath", "type": "sz", "data": "/run/eventd/query.sock" },
        { "name": "LogSocketPath",   "type": "sz", "data": "/run/eventd/log.sock" },
        { "name": "MetricSocketPath","type": "sz", "data": "/run/eventd/metric.sock" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
